A [[Gamorrean]] '''fighter''' fought [[Unidentified Gamorrean fighter 1|another fighter]] in [[Gor Koresh's Honky Tonk|Carnita arena]]<ref name="Chapter 9" /> in [[9 ABY]].<ref name="Date">{{MandoDate|9}}</ref> [[Gor Koresh]] [[Gambling|bet]] on this fighter to win the fight but the fighter wasn't doing good. The fighter was on the ground and was going to get [[Death|finished]] until Koresh shot the other fighter and then held a [[Mandalorian]] named [[Din Djarin]] at gunpoint for [[Din Djarin's armor|his armor]]. Djarin then fought Koresh and his allies, while the Gamorrean fighter attempted to jump on Djarin but failed then landed on and broke a table.<ref name="Chapter 9" />

